- The patch adds a check at the start of the `render` method to ensure the layer is only rendered if it is effectively visible (i.e., its own `visible` property and all parent group visibilities are `true`).
- This matches the behavior of other layer types and fixes the bug where `WebGlTile` layers remain visible when their parent group is hidden.

